","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"R2I0DYnyEjn-Eu5eweuOQQ","review_id":"K9nT0pQ5wvgwml3IfdvdZQ","date":"2019-12-20T19:31:26","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9408020973205566,"text_excerpt":"I thoroughly enjoy coming to Good Friends for a night out. The drinks are super reasonable but what I enjoy most is the upstairs and balcony area. The music is always on point and there's always a decent crowd upstairs. As I've had the chance to live in the city this year, I've noticed the upstairs area out of habit is where the locals tend to go to immediately. All the bartenders are super friendly though. Jeremy is seriously the gatekeeper of the upstairs bar and does a great job of remembering regulars' names and preferred drink orders. It's like he's already pouring my double ruby red soda upon arrival. Such a great spot for tourists and friends alike. Best part... no cover charge and..."},{"business_id":"R2I0DYnyEjn-Eu5eweuOQQ","review_id":"uU0dSN9LEKl7U_Ltp3Z_1w","date":"2017-01-10T20:25:21","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9357184171676636,"text_excerpt":"Ahhh Good Friends! This has become my favorite bar in NOLA. It's off the beaten path of Bourbon St, so you can chill out a bit and feel more like a local. Don't get me wrong, this place can and will get crazy packed. I prefer to close out the night here because it just relaxing and straight up friendly. Ambience: Lots of 90s and early 2000 mixes with of course the usual top 40. No weird looks or mean bartenders. This is a trickle down from the great management. I'm not sure if Michael is the top dog or not but he is a great bartender and clearly a great manager. (Remembering faces, pouring great drinks, and always wearing a smile). Bo is also just as friendly! Drinks: you can get a $5 blo..."},{"business_id":"R2I0DYnyEjn-Eu5eweuOQQ","review_id":"PdE3ekUCuz70u24Lfl31pQ","date":"2010-08-19T01:52:53","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9326866865158081,"text_excerpt":"i could sit around at good friends drinking and shooting the shit alllll daaayyy looong. love that place. bartenders are cute and super attentive and the people watching is excellent. not too sure about the night scene there. more of a first drink of the day kind of place for me. x"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"R2I0DYnyEjn-Eu5eweuOQQ","photo_id":"aFDOhMZbNVuVbq_iEzvVDQ","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/aFDOhMZbNVuVbq_iEzvVDQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.83617103099823},{"business_id":"R2I0DYnyEjn-Eu5eweuOQQ","photo_id":"o1uiZDvRGWOIynM0dmtMxw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/o1uiZDvRGWOIynM0dmtMxw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8354789018630981},{"business_id":"R2I0DYnyEjn-Eu5eweuOQQ","photo_id":"68MfluycsOrFRvxZkjqjWA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/68MfluycsOrFRvxZkjqjWA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.81133633852005},{"business_id":"R2I0DYnyEjn-Eu5eweuOQQ","photo_id":"KmIlUQUe1-fG1M5LcpXnpQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/KmIlUQUe1-fG1M5LcpXnpQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7659249305725098}]},"notebook_case":null}
